{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_05_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_05","title":"遭弃者","storyCode":"SV-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"48afb976f6ab521aedf8d12c912c25b66c603f935a3e4883df59e3411980066c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯卡蒂以一己之力撕碎成百上千怪物，力竭之际，再次遭遇年轻审判官。审判官想要带走她，却被当地居民阻拦。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你都、你都看到了吗？刚才？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那种事，她竟然都能办到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那是歌手。歌手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官，如果是她的话，她从来能办到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手......歌手。你还在叫她歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不然叫啥哩？你是审判官，你告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我要出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么？你以为连你都能拉住我？我可是审判官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这滑腻腻的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......打、打到了！差一点，审判官，好险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏你刚劈碎了这张椅子，我好拿起来当武器，把这东西砸烂呢。要不然它就要爬到你头上去啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你这人！你们这里的人真是太奇怪了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"看到这些东西，你都不害怕的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"有一点。不过还好，没有审判官可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......你居然，把我，和这些怪物相提并论？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。我不跟你计较。你没见过这些，不知道它们能做什么，又怎么会觉得害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，外面还有别的居民出来了。他们......他们在做什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们也一点都不害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我要看清楚问题所在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......盐。很咸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那个，能吃。都没了。可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"盐也能吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"能吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"多一点，再多一点......唔呃，呕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"弄脏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"咽下去。更多一点......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有话要问你。你跟我说清楚——什么叫来找你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我流血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你流血了，你输给了老师，负伤逃走。这和这群......怪物突然出现有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们闻到我血的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"它们......是来杀你的？我看到它们争先恐后地朝你扑过去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"或许？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们还伤不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你这个人！你知不知道你说话的语气很让人讨厌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在说事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"它们——我是说这些怪物——它们不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"消失得干干净净，就跟从未出现过一样。要不是刚刚看得清清楚楚，简直跟做梦似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这怪物......恐鱼。我以前也见过不少。长得不太一样，都散发着同样的令人厌恶的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"但那时候都是海滩上，而且远远没有这么多。它们难道不是在海里生活的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"人只有走到海边，才会被找麻烦吧？就和你白天一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"现在它们却爬了这么远，就快涌上街道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们能去很多地方。改变形貌，扩散，渗透。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钢铁铸就的城市，高地之上的村庄，黄沙遍布的荒野。我去，它们就也能去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大地被海洋包裹。看不见海的地方，海水未必就不能触到。它是活着的，流动的。它带来的灾厄也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道有些地方的大海很危险。我不知道原来伊比利亚之外的陆地上也会......遭受威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威胁，始终都在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这些的话，这是我带来的灾祸。靠近我，你也会受波及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你到底是什么人啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"别跟我说你是什么流浪歌手！我全都看见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你和它们作战。而且你熟悉这种战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀死它们时候的技巧，比和我、和长官战斗时候还要娴熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人类的手感没那么好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，别说这些奇怪的话了......哪怕你是个奇怪的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前......是猎人么？你的眼神看起来很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得是就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你狩猎的对象是这些......恐鱼么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们需要被清除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......还是这讨人厌的口气。不知道为什么，说这话的人是你的话，我竟然觉得不是大话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，猎人......随你是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"从刚才的情形来看，你可以说救了我，也救了这一条街、甚至整个城镇的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能是敌人的敌人，可我也没办法把你当成朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，出于我的职责，我必须把你带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是问我来这里的意图么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来这里，只是想找答案。这个答案，只和我自己......以及我要找的人有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才可没说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也没怎么给我说的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你说了，我的判决也不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你不属于这座城市。像你这样的人，出现在这里，就是错误的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用说......你自己交代是你带来了灾祸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——虽然和我设想的有些不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，阿戈尔人，你很危险。你对这座城市来说，是危险。这座城市对你来说，也是危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那些人。他们在......啃食那些恐鱼留下的尸体残屑。他们并不畏惧这些怪物......不，他们甚至不知道什么是怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"感到饥饿，就进食。怪物们也是这样。而只有人类......人类才会恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......还是人类吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道他们在努力活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在想活下去这件事上，人类，怪物，本来就没什么分别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"活着......这样活着，也算活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官让我自己看。我现在才明白他是什么意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市里，最大的问题不是这些居民在做什么。而是他们竟然还活着——这才是最大的不正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他们和你一样危险。危险必须被控制，就如错误务必得纠正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还没有放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在更不能放过你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我说过了。我还有事要做，时间很紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能再来打一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人，我知道你受了伤，为了打退这么多恐鱼怕是也费了不少力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我不会手下留情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这是什么东西？一小块贝壳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你扔的，阿戈尔人......你也不至于朝我扔贝壳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是这些趴在地上呕吐的当地人？不，不可能。他们连吃进肚子里的东西是什么都辨不清楚，不会对我出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是从旁边的窗户？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在做这种事？快站出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你？是你扔的贝壳吗？你还是要拦着我，要保护这个阿戈尔人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是、是我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"小安妮，你别乱说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶？！你、你不要出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"是我扔的，审判官大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我知道你是哪种人，而他们什么都不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里竟然也还有正常人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫人，你或许是眼神不好。麻烦你先退下，眼前有一些危险事务必须解决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"看呀，审判官大人。我眼神可好得很呢。就算天黑透了，我也能打中你，只要你忘了躲开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"小小的贝壳呀，美丽的浪花♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"一枚又一枚，一朵又一朵......一朵又一朵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你承认，那我便必须——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官......大人！佩特拉奶奶她，她病了......您不要怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"病了？难怪。是的，我看得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我的小安妮，你又在乱说话了。我哪里病了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶，你别说了，求你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"病了......病了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"得病的明明是这座盐风城！是——是这个地方，是这儿的每一个人！还有你，高高在上的，审判官大人......你也病得不轻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你，把老人家带回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有更重要的事情要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"什么重要的事情？还有什么事情，比活命更重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......作为审判官，有的是值得用性命去维护的东西。比如说，律法所说的一切正确的事，还有我们的这个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"用性命去维护......谁的性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......算了，我同你说这些做什么？衰老与疾病使你丧失理智，市民，我可以原谅你的疯狂举止，只要你为更重要的事情让路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官大人，你说的什么，对错，国家，我都听不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想问问你，你要维护的东西，是不是从来就不包括我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你们带走过一些人。你们说他们扰乱秩序，因为他们为了抢夺食物而犯下了伤害罪，哪怕他们只是想活命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那次不是我......不过既然他们犯了罪，便理当如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"他们之后就没再回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"把做坏事的人带走，生活就会变好么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"将带来混乱的因素及时去除，自然就能迎来有序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"然而食物还是越来越少......上了年纪的人不是饿死就是病死，就连好多年轻人都熬不过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你口口声声说的秩序......是不是就是想让我们安静地死去？这样就不会发出任何噪音，影响高贵的大人们在柔软床铺上心安理得地入眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"整个伊比利亚都在受苦，不独你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"为了争抢资源而伤害他人的罪人难道不该被制止么？假如我们面前是十份粮食，本来可以喂饱十个伊比利亚居民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"如果无人告诉他们自己应得的是多少，他们便会争斗不休。到最后，这十个人中只能活一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"一片混乱之中，是审判庭划定了对错界限，引领人们往对的路上去。若非如此，整个国家都将一早溃成散沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的这些......我都摸不着，也看不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有路。大人，你说的路，在哪里？当我们真的想要一条路的时候，你在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我想帮你们。我在为成为审判官而努力。我走上这条路，就是想帮每一个人。我坚信这是唯一正确的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我......帮我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望过。幻想过。渴望过。我做梦都希望有人能来救救我们。无数个夜晚，我喊得嗓子都哑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你们没有来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是只有做错了事，你们才会来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我这把老骨头，竟然偷生到现在。真是悲惨。我活着的每一天，都是折磨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我在攻击你，瞧啊，审判官大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你快把我带走呀！带走我，终结我这条残喘的无意义的性命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"快些，快些！我等不及了——我等了那么些年！咳咳，咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想还手。你的愤怒......很正常。我的剑不该是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"市民，请不要逼我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是小安妮啊。你也到广场上来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"天黑了，为什么还是没有歌声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你不是说你是歌手吗？你为什么不唱歌？你的琴呢？我想跳舞，你给我伴奏吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你，审判官大人，你还没有一个流浪歌手有用。她会唱歌给我们听。她还会......还会勇敢地站在我们身前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕怪物，也不怕死。我怕这种生活。我是不是疯了，安妮塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶，没事的。你在发抖，只是因为冷了。我们回去吧好不好？回去躺下，你会好受些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好。走吧，往回走。反正我也不知道该往哪里去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你改主意了么？要是改主意了，你还来得及将我带走，或者将我处死。那样的话......至少我可以死得像一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"趁我还没死，审判官大人，这没几天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，走吧......歌手，和我们一起走。我想听你唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我会......暂且，放过你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"但我会回来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你，阿戈尔人。我会弄清楚这一切。你休想轻松逃离我的视线！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼，好险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你还好吗？你的脸色好白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"可不要逞强啦。审判官大人真的走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道你不怕。你这样的人，又会怕什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是坏人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我离开，对你们是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好事？咱这地方怕是没有什么好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你也别看佩特拉奶奶那样，她也不是恨审判官，她恨的是别的，我知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"跳起来啊，哈哈，我喜欢歌声......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"别转啦奶奶，你累了。歌手会唱歌的，对不对啊歌手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，歌手，把手给我吧，我看看你伤得怎样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不能靠近你，因为会有危险对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。我信你。真有什么，你也能赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"看，伤口没那么严重，已经不流血啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你真厉害，连伤都好得这么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是慢了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"伤是还行，你的模样却不太好。你刚才挑的房子都给轰烂啦，就连你也没法好好躺下吧？我看你还是跟我还有佩特拉奶奶一块回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"对，待在一块，不让他们来找你麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，别说“不用”“没必要”“我还有事情做了”，我都听腻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你，是没力气了吧？你现在啊，真的需要人照看，好好睡上一觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，你要找的人，她一定也不想看你这么勉强自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那些......都是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......这和我都没有关系了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我不该再问问题。我得到了答案，我认得路，知道该往哪里走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"往前......只要往前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"明天大家都会有食物。我......不，我们，都能活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们想活下去。所以我们更加爱彼此。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"“因为爱，我们紧密相连。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"“我将变得更强健......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们的族群也将变得更强健。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"她的琴。掉在了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"（学着斯卡蒂的姿势拨琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"（叮咚、叮咚）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"真难听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"没有意义的东西。就该丢下，烂掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
